  "title": "Ph Insurance Faqs Objections — Objection 1: \"Masyadong mahal ang premium / The premium is too expensive\"",
  "content": "### Objection 1: \"Masyadong mahal ang premium / The premium is too expensive\"\n- **Context**: The customer feels insurance is beyond their current budget.\n- **Handling Approach (Taglish / English)**:\n  - *\"Naiintindihan ko po kayo. Pero ang kagandahan po sa Darwix, pwede po nating i-customize ang plan para swak sa inyong budget. Meron po tayong SecureTerm na nagsisimula lamang sa humigit-kumulang ₱1,500 kada buwan - o ₱50 lang bawat araw, kasing halaga lang ng isang merienda o kape. Gusto niyo po bang gawan natin ng quotation na pasok sa inyong buwanang budget?\"*\n  - *\"I completely understand your concern. The great thing with Darwix is that we customize the policy to your specific budget. Our SecureTerm starts at around ₱1,500 per month - just about ₱50 a day, which is the cost of a daily cup of coffee or merienda. Would you like to review a plan customized to your monthly budget?\"*",
  "context_header": "[Document: ph_insurance_faqs_objections.md] [Product: Philippines Life Insurance] [Category: faq] [Section: Objection 1: \"Masyadong mahal ang premium / The premium is too expensive\"]",
